WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:07.327
This is the flag of Earth, designed
by Oskar Pernefeldt of Sweden.

00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:09.367
Just imagine with me for a second:

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.373
What if we celebrated our humanity

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:17.897
as much if not more than we 
celebrate our nationalities? 

00:00:18.605 --> 00:00:22.846
As we become a spacefaring civilization 
and we go off into the stars,

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:25.076
what do our nations mean anyway

00:00:25.076 --> 00:00:28.609
when you're standing on the surface
of Mars or any other planet?

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:31.753
And then of course, back here on Earth,

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:35.241
as our planet is facing a climate crisis, 

00:00:35.241 --> 00:00:39.552
as our climate could be unlivable in our 
children or grandchildren's lifetime,

00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:42.703
I believe we need a strong symbol,

00:00:42.703 --> 00:00:44.138
a flag,

00:00:44.138 --> 00:00:46.059
to unite us to fight,

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:51.045
not just as nations, but as a species.

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:52.301
Thank you.

